Gets the Grid CSV file as a .

Specifies whether to return the CSV as a memory stream.
Optional. Provides the Excel export properties such as custom columns, data sources, themes, etc.

An asynchronous task that provides a  containing the exported CSV file when  parameter is true;
otherwise, it returns null and exports the CSV file in the browser.


This method will only export the csv file if the  is set to true.
It exports the Grid sheet to a CSV file (.csv) in the browser by defining  parameter value to false.

Also, see  for details on configuring export properties.


<button id="ExportToExcel<"@onclick="ExportHandler">ExportToCsv<</button>
<SfGrid @ref="grid" AllowExcelExport="true" DataSource="@Orders">
 ........
</SfGrid>
@code{
   SfGrid<Order> grid;
   private async Task ExportHandler()
   {
       Syncfusion.Blazor.Grids.ExcelExportProperties ExportProperties = new Syncfusion.Blazor.Grids.ExcelExportProperties();
       ExportProperties.ExportType = Syncfusion.Blazor.Grids.ExportType.CurrentPage; // here we have changed the ExportType from AllPages to CurrentPage, as like same we can change our desire properties.
       MemoryStream streamDocument = await grid.ExportToCsvAsync(true, ExportProperties);
   }
}


Gets the Grid Excel sheet as a .

Specifies whether to return the Excel worksheet as a memory stream.
Optional. Provides the excel export properties such as custom columns, data sources, themes, etc.

An asynchronous task that provides a  containing the exported Excel data when asMemoryStream parameter is true;
otherwise, it returns null and exports the Excel sheet in browser.


It exports the Grid sheet to an Excel file (.xlsx) in the browser by defining asMemoryStream parameter value to false.

Also, see  for details on configuring export properties.


