members.member:

 Adds a rule to the specified group in the Query Builder.

 The  to be added.
 The ID of the group where the rule will be added.
 If set to true, the rule is added as a new group. The default value is false.

 This method allows for the dynamic addition of rules to a specified group.
 If  is true, the rule is encapsulated within a new group, allowing for nested conditions.
 Otherwise, the rule is added directly to the bottom of the specified group.

